{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39118","headline":"访含弘山僧不遇留题精舍 · 韦庄","name":"访含弘山僧不遇留题精舍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"满院桐花鸟雀喧，寂寥芳草茂芊芊。\n吾师正遇归山日，闲客空题到寺年。\n池竹闭门教鹤守，琴书开箧任僧传。\n人间不自寻行迹，一片孤云在碧天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39118.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39118","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}